    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="编码"><a href="#编码" class="headerlink" title="编码"></a>编码</h1><h2 id="ASCII编码"><a href="#ASCII编码" class="headerlink" title="ASCII编码"></a>ASCII编码</h2><p><img src="/images/ASCII%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81%E8%A1%A8.jpg"><br>可以使用<code>ord()</code>函数将字符转换为ASCII码，使用<code>chr()</code>函数将ASCII码转换为字符。<br>例：</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>In[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>]: ch=<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;a&#x27;</span><br><span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>In[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>]: <span class="hljs-built_in">ord</span>(ch)<br>    Out[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>]: <span class="hljs-number">97</span><br><span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>In[<span class="hljs-number">3</span>]: <span class="hljs-built_in">chr</span>(<span class="hljs-number">97</span>)<br>    Out[<span class="hljs-number">3</span>]: <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;a&#x27;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="Base系列编码"><a href="#Base系列编码" class="headerlink" title="Base系列编码"></a>Base系列编码</h3>]]></content>
    
    
      
      
